 CellLabel->"Out[2]= ",ExpressionUUID->"bef1b904-34b6-4b7e-81b7-e09110da446f"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
A ray is a geodesic that stops only because it must; a walk right round a \
cycle is not a geodesic at all.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"544e2f9e-df52-4f3e-bb19-590f4b39e7fa"],

